For Keccak (the FIPS 202 SHA-3/SHAKE code, e.g. fips202.c) and the random number
generator, public-domain code from the sources and by the authors listed in the
comments at the top of the respective files is used.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This directory contains the upstream pq-crystals/dilithium reference sources,
used UNMODIFIED as the ML-DSA digital-signature primitive of the DKEX handshake
(invoked through the pluggable signature interface; replaceable by any conforming
post-quantum signature). It is a standardized third-party component, NOT an
original contribution of this submission, and is OUTSIDE the scope of the B.3
reference-and-optimized-implementation ownership statement.

The full Apache-2.0 license text is available from the Apache Software Foundation
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). See the package Dependency Statement
(依赖说明) for further details.
